---
title: "A field note"
date: 2026-05-01
---

This page sets a `title:` and a `date:` but no `author:` of its own, so it renders **no
byline at all**: the byline is built from the page's own front matter and nothing else.
The site-level `author:` in `_site.yml` is not a fallback for it — that key is read only
when a dated listing writes its Atom feed, where RFC 4287 requires an author element.
